<title>USA: Ampal-American takes stake in PowerDsine.</title>
<headline>Ampal-American takes stake in PowerDsine.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ampal-American Israel Corp said Friday it bought a 12.5 percent stake in PowerDsine Ltd of Israel for $2 million.</p>
<p>PowerDsine is a manufacturer of modules and components for the telecommunications industry, an Ampal statement said.</p>
<p>Ampal's stock traded at 6 Friday morning, down 1/8.</p>
</text>
